er in Saint Petersburg, 23:30 local time, 22 June 2013","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAdmiralty_Embankment_of_Neva_River_in_Saint_Petersburg_during_the_White_nightsIMG_4236.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Norra_Hamn_Lule%C3%A5.jpg/500px-Norra_Hamn_Lule%C3%A5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Norra_Hamn_Lule%C3%A5.jpg/1280px-Norra_Hamn_Lule%C3%A5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Norra_Hamn_Lule%C3%A5.jpg/500px-Norra_Hamn_Lule%C3%A5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Summer night in the city of Luleå, Sweden on May 30, 2013. Although the sun sets, it remains light throughout the night.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANorra_Hamn_Lule%C3%A5.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Midnight_sun_dates_svatlas.png/500px-Midnight_sun_dates_svatlas.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Midnight_sun_dates_svatlas.png/1280px-Midnight_sun_dates_svatlas.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Midnight_sun_dates_svatlas.png/500px-Midnight_sun_dates_svatlas.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Map showing the dates of midnight sun at various latitudes (left) and the total number of nights","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMidnight_sun_dates_svatlas.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Optical_effect_march_sunset_-_NOAA.jpg/500px-Optical_effect_march_sunset_-_NOAA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Optical_effect_march_sunset_-_NOAA.jpg/1280px-Optical_effect_march_sunset_-_NOAA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Optical_effect_march_sunset_-_NOAA.jpg/500px-Optical_effect_march_sunset_-_NOAA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"At Earth's poles the Sun appears at the horizon only and all day around equinox, marking the change between the half year long polar night and polar day. The picture shows the South Pole right before March equinox, with the Sun appearing through refraction despite being still below the horizon.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOptical_effect_march_sunset_-_NOAA.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/MNEK_Glatsonbury_Festival_2014_by_neal_whitehouse_piper_cropped.jpg/500px-MNEK_Glatsonbury_Festival_2014_by_neal_whitehouse_piper_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/MNEK_Glatsonbury_Festival_2014_by_neal_whitehouse_piper_cropped.jpg/1280px-MNEK_Glatsonbury_Festival_2014_by_neal_whitehouse_piper_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/MNEK_Glatsonbury_Festival_2014_by_neal_whitehouse_piper_cropped.jpg/500px-MNEK_Glatsonbury_Festival_2014_by_neal_whitehouse_piper_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"In Midnight Sun, Larsson worked with her longtime collaborator MNEK (pictured).","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMNEK_Glatsonbury_Festival_2014_by_neal_whitehouse_piper_cropped.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Zara_Larsson_Concert_Tour_2026_%28Cropped%29.png/330px-Zara_Larsson_